WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.930
Think about how you paid
for your last snack.

2
00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:06.670
Maybe cash. Maybe a card
linked to a checking account.

3
00:00:06.670 --> 00:00:08.450
Both count as money.

4
00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:10.930
Before money, people had to barter:

5
00:00:10.930 --> 00:00:12.840
swapping goods directly.

6
00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.140
And barter only works if
each person wants exactly

7
00:00:16.140 --> 00:00:17.610
what the other has.

8
00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:20.190
That's the double coincidence of wants.

9
00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:22.830
So why will a shop swap
a meal for a printed

10
00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:26.160
slip of paper but not for a bag of apples?

11
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:29.700
In this mission, you'll learn
the three functions of money.

12
00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.720
Then you'll climb a ladder of assets,

13
00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:36.220
from cash to stocks,
and calculate M1 and M2.

14
00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:39.890
Your mission: find out what
turns something into money.
